    lg2: held
  }
  class lg0 blue
  class lg1 teal
  class lg2 orange
  s0: Signed intent ready
  s1: Failure held
  s2: Unknown bytes observed, held
  s3: Staging and verifying target bytes
  s4: Target staged on all controls
  s5: Stopping old services
  s6: All old services stopped
  s7: Target selected on all controls
  s8: Starting target services
  s9: Checking singleton health
  s10: Target healthy, pins pending
  s11: Target healthy, pins durable
  [*] --> s0
  s0 --> s1: unsigned, expired or mismatched intent is rejected or failure or ambiguous outcome, preserve journal
  s0 --> s2: unexpected bytes found, hold without overwrite
  s0 --> s3: controller admits the fresh signed intent
  s3 --> s4: all target bytes verify on every control
  s4 --> s5: all three staged, begin the stop window
  s5 --> s1: failure or ambiguous outcome, preserve journal
  s5 --> s6: all old services stop
  s6 --> s2: unexpected bytes found, hold without overwrite
  s6 --> s7: select target bytes on every stopped control
  s7 --> s8: all three select target, begin startup
  s8 --> s1: failure or ambiguous outcome, preserve journal
  s8 --> s2: unexpected bytes found, hold without overwrite
  s1 --> s8: resume same signed target from durable checkpoint
  s8 --> s9: target services start on all controls
  s9 --> s10: singleton and backend health pass
  s9 --> s2: unexpected bytes found, hold without overwrite
  s10 --> s11: persist target pins and retire runner
